cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VBDS, please cite the benchmark and the original source datasets listed in SOURCE_LICENSES.md."
title: "VBDS: A Visual-Cue Benchmark and Dataset for Sensitive-Content Identification in Aerial Imagery"
abstract: >-
  VBDS is a 26-class object-detection benchmark for sensitive visual cues in aerial and
  low-altitude imagery, drawn from 16 source units and annotated in a single COCO taxonomy.
  This repository releases the redistributable subset, the annotations for that subset, and the
  metadata needed to reproduce the benchmark from legally obtained originals.
